+- **N18 — View math zero/degenerate guards.** view.odin:58-60: `from_screen` divides by `v.scale` with no zero guard (minimized window / `tile_px` 0 → inf/NaN world coords; snap degrades via IEEE but the drag ghost consumes NaN); hud.odin:220-227: `popover_rect` clamps right/top/bottom but not left (anchor within 228 px of the left edge → popover off-screen). Guard: `if v.scale <= 0 { return 0, 0 }`; clamp `x = max(8, x)`.
