-## CrisisDirector "interface" (architecture §10.4 substitutable-service convention).
-##
-## GDScript has no interface/protocol keyword (and `trait` is reserved, [FinLT]),
-## so this is an abstract base whose methods assert "override me". The MVP impl
-## is ScriptedDirector (data-driven, deterministic); the V2 AiAuditorDirector
-## (post-launch, forge weak #4) implements the same seam. Consumers hold the
-## base type; swapping impls is config (ADR-7).
-##
-## Never instantiate the base directly (S0.5 AC: base asserts on direct use).
-class_name CrisisDirector
-extends RefCounted
-
-
-## Plan the demand/pressure for one tick from (topology, era, tick, rng).
-## Deterministic: same (seed, era, tick) -> identical PressurePlan (NFR1, S0.5).
